  <item>
    <title>No.16 执着于“把话说开”你舒服吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69917e6bde29766da9a7388f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69917e6bde29766da9a7388f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 08:10:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在生活中总是有一些矛盾的时刻：</span></p><span></span><p><span>要么“把话说清楚”，要么“沉默着就过去”</span></p><span></span><p><span>似乎每次还来不及思考，身体本能的情绪已给出了答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【文章】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="http://xhslink.com/o/5RcoXdrFryU " data-url="http://xhslink.com/o/5RcoXdrFryU "><span>《为什么你非要“把话说开”才舒服 》——拾光溪云咨询</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 人生课题——为什么你非要“把话说开”才舒服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> “把话说开”的几个误区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">09:13</a> 不把话说开的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a> 把话说开的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> 要不要捅破窗花纸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a> 对方到底想听真话还是60%的真话</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>邓紫棋《倒数》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@新奇-泡菜&amp;@李脖脖儿</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝大家新年快乐！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
