    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前段时间我们的播客一直徘徊在选题上，导致停滞在原地</span></p><span></span><p><span>很多创作者可能都曾经历过创作困境，希望这期播客可以成为创作者们和混沌世界的桥梁，灵感泉涌</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">2:24</a> 播客创作的瓶颈是因为选题吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">5:29</a> 对选题有“强迫症”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 曾经的播客选题满意度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a> 从喜剧创作中受益</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a> 近期播客工作态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 播客有时效性吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 对播客这件事的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鑫奇-泡菜 &amp; @李脖脖儿</span></p>]]></description>
