  <item>
    <title>No.14 老友36问：我们一直走在成长的大道上</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c2dd132c82c9dccae5ef9c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c2dd132c82c9dccae5ef9c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Sep 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔一年，我们再次拿出“老友三十六问”。“会有变化吗？”我们也在暗自问自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当我们拿着今年的答案和去年对比时，竟发现成长的脚步我们又迈出去很远了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在此也感谢听友们一年的陪伴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> bobo说：“请让我和小孩坐一桌。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a>自信让泡菜的生活变得精简</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a>想唱？哪不是KTV!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2678">44:38</a>友情对我们来说代表了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3507">58:27</a>对未来可能会成为朋友的人说的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3853">1:04:13</a>泡菜和bobo又进入思辨状态了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4382">1:13:02</a>重磅故事来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鑫奇-泡菜&amp;@李脖脖儿</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/644665d6841b614725055834/lkyODWq046IK5jNCEqkjNu2VaXJJ.m4a" length="122338213" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:24:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrnUuOrFzHB3eR8i4qE3ynFYi3BM.jpg"/>
