  <item>
    <title>No.13 从生日聊到“仪式”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6839851831215eb5068ce7b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6839851831215eb5068ce7b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 10:18:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们立了一个规矩，在想聊天的时候必须打开录音，因为我们有太多好话题不经意间溜走了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期是从我们平常聊天中截取的一段，百分百四川话。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 聊聊我们过生日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 对十八岁生日的想象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a> 认识14年不知道对方生日在哪天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 人生清单里要有举办生日派对这件事吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> 从生日聊到“仪式”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a> 仪式是举办给自己的，也是举办给别人的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> 九宫格照片在多数人眼中就是张白纸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 把仪式交还给仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鑫奇&amp;@李脖脖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《生日愿望》——王铮亮</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/644665d6841b614725055834/llVopc8KiC9uw68XxDSLllYxWmW-.m4a" length="16184458" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:16:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrnUuOrFzHB3eR8i4qE3ynFYi3BM.jpg"/>
