  <item>
    <title>No.12 《苦尽柑来遇见你》：大家又一次共情了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6804e9e5cdd692da15846b41</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6804e9e5cdd692da15846b41</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Apr 2025 12:41:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这部剧让我们哭了太多次。</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱情的美好和亲情的共鸣让我们不约而同地想来聊一聊这部剧，本期播客也主要围绕这两个方面分享了我们的一些思考。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlW3_O2H6MEKQuHgUhU5LhOfnnbs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（图片来源于豆瓣）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提到的镜头】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgUWwqDHkOo9eOwdLba0DtGnMBpi.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrpkJmCKd448PDIM2o7CvDtDTu6Q.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjfgIXFt6UbDBfZFUcjvK5EPcXF.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（图片来源于网络）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">4:45</a>正文开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a>梁宽植和吴爱纯的爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">8:17</a>梁、吴爱情里什么令你印象深刻？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:6</a>自我思考：为什么不期待这样的爱情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a>夫妻之间是“零寸”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a>梁金明是位有爱的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a>对剧中亲情的深刻感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a>这种亲情状态如何形成的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1887">31:27</a>历史如何反复出现在每个人的生命中？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a>爱的感应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2166">36:06</a>第二次哭：梁金明煤气中毒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">41:02</a>第三次哭：爸妈意外发现梁金明怀孕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2933">48:53</a>镜头拍摄的美感、回味剧本结尾、媒体产品传播的东亚文化和价值观获得共鸣</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鑫奇&amp;@李脖脖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kim Jung Mi《Spring》——片尾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝大家感情顺顺利利，幸幸福福！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
