  <item>
    <title>No.11 眼见不一定为实，耳听不一定为虚（俄罗斯篇）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f4efe50decaeb094b0af93</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f4efe50decaeb094b0af93</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Apr 2025 10:21:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>接着上一期我们聊完韩国后，俄罗斯篇马不停蹄地赶来啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a> 为什么大家对俄罗斯不好奇？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">3:36</a>俄罗斯年轻人竟然也喜欢消费日韩文化！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">4:23</a>俄罗斯的恶劣天气对你的生活有什么影响吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">7:17</a>俄乌战争对你的生活有影响吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a>我们经常听说在俄罗斯有恐怖袭击？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a>俄罗斯人都是酒蒙子吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="924">15:24</a>不成文的规定——酒吧不许睡觉！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a>你在俄罗斯见过少数民族吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">21:58</a>俄罗斯人与熊“共舞”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a>俄罗斯人都是糙汉子吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a>俄罗斯有能精致一辈子的男性吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a>俄罗斯人吃的甜吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a>俄罗斯中年人发福严重吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1997">33:17</a>略显成熟的同龄俄罗斯人和“显小“的亚洲人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2093">34:53</a>俄罗斯商品馆保真吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a>旅游建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鑫奇&amp;@李脖脖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Катюша》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎游玩首尔和圣彼得堡！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
