    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dede6778103db3bd37f6b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Mar 2025 18:00:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>过年回家之后我们也经常被问到关于韩国和俄罗斯的具体情况，接下来两期播客我们就来解答解答大家的好奇心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a> 在国内也很喜欢吃韩餐的你们在首尔依然寻找中餐馆？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 国内的韩餐对比韩国的韩餐正宗吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 韩国人对待冰美式比欧洲人还积极？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 内卷和压力大到早上5点占自习室？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a> 追星文化浓厚吗？街上很多时候都能偶遇明星？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 前辈文化深入人心？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 遍地都是便利店？韩国的便利店你们吃得惯吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 鑫奇对韩国文化的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2419">40:19</a> 韩国的ins风灯饰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 韩式穿搭</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鑫奇&amp;@李脖脖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《IF YOU》——BIGBANG</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>下期俄罗斯见！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
