    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fc395481cdab3a936224cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2024 18:03:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>非常高兴地邀请了鑫奇的好朋友琪琪来我们播客做客，这也是我们迈出多人播客形式的第一步</span></p><span></span><p><span>琪琪说：“你们居然能把聊天当作生活中的一件事来看待！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>鑫奇&amp;脖脖说：“聊天就是我们生活中的一部分。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期就来聊聊“聊天”这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">2:25</a>“我突然好想聊天啊。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">8:04</a> 聊天开始于自然而然地分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>聊天对自己的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a>朋友&amp;家人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a>熟人只是熟人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a>“需要”聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2288">38:08</a>聊天也需要被正视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">44:03</a>非常治愈的描述（强烈推荐！！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a>不要让聊天成为另一种伤害</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鑫奇&amp;@李脖脖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>飞行嘉宾 @佳琪佳琪佳佳琪</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《A Broken Heart Heals with Time》——片头</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一荤一素》——片尾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝祖国母亲生日快乐！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
