  <item>
    <title>No.6 我们没有蛐蛐“蛐蛐”这件事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a9019c7349f7a557a4215e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a9019c7349f7a557a4215e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jul 2024 15:07:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>什么叫蛐蛐别人？你有蛐蛐过别人吗，换句话说，你有无端攻击谩骂过别人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么叫八卦？你有八卦吃瓜过吗，换句话说，你有浅显地了解事情并传播它吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么叫讨论？你有理智讨论过吗，换句话说，你有发现事情背后的秘密并进行反思吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客就来聊聊蛐蛐、八卦以及讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2833">47:13</a> 前：辨析 “蛐蛐、八卦、讨论”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2833">47:13</a> 后：总结&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鑫奇&amp;@李脖脖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>未闻花名——片头</span></p><span></span><p><span>米店——片尾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝大家暑期愉快！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrxO0FOS3SfpdIhoPtBV0dt2ZgxT.m4a" length="54313260" type="audio/mp4"/>
