  <item>
    <title>No.5 纠结委婉还是直接，不如怎么舒服怎么说！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665f877d94977a26ef3d8001</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665f877d94977a26ef3d8001</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Jun 2024 21:30:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一场由“表达”开始，到“找寻真实自我”为止的心灵旅行。起源于我们心底里对于“表达”的各种困惑。生活是一场修行，反省是最好的法门，通过反省也常常能看见真实的自我，谁说委婉表达就比直接表达不好，面对真实的自己，怎么舒服怎么说！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客让我们一起看看互相的聊天记录，正视自己的表达，收获真实的自我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">2:13</a> 表达小白和自成一体的表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">3:20</a>“安慰”（鑫奇）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">9:48</a>不回微信消息，你会怎么看？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a>“称谓”（脖脖）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">15:31</a>你是否会试探对方回消息的欲望吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a>“解释”（鑫奇）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a>“帮助”（脖脖）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">22:04</a>你认为给对方提供的帮助对方会用吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a>请你明白我的敷衍：快点结束这个话题！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a>“评价”（鑫奇）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a>“解释”（脖脖）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2184">36:24</a>两种交友方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a>“主动放弃自我”鑫奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2526">42:06</a>“直接表达情绪”脖脖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a>重要的不是对方，而是我的行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2864">47:44</a>分享对对方表达的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a>用直接表达脱掉自己的盔甲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3663">1:01:03</a>没有必要那么懂事！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3752">1:02:32</a>真实的“我”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【两位主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鑫奇&amp;@李脖脖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>溯 —— 片头钢琴曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>别问很可怕 —— 片尾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝大家在认识真实自己的道路上多多收获，在表达的路上找到自我。By the way，高考的同学们都上岸！！！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
